\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1  \cf0  A host of Angels came from heav'n
\par \pard\li225\sl202\slmult0  appeared to shepherds in the field
\par  with news that a son child is born
\par and lying in a poor estate.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  In Bethlehem, David's city
\par \pard\li225\sl202\slmult0 As was prophesied by Micah
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1 our master Jesus Christ is He\cf0 
\par a saviour born for all nations.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Be very happy real indeed
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  because God Himself is with us
\par         born in the flesh just as you are
\par   God's son is your own brother.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  He just cannot forsake you all
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0    you put your trust in him alone
\par      if troubled by your enemies
\par     you shall be all victorious.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  And in the end you shall be freed
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0  because you are children of God
\par  and so be thankful to the Lord
\par \pard          for He shall always comfort you.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

